    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to announce 194 Landen Road to the sales market, a charming three-bedroom, one-bathroom home.\r\n\r\nThis lovely walk in ready family home consists of the ground floor featuring a lovely bright and spacious living room, complete with an under-stairs storage unit for added convenience. The large kitchen offers ample space for cooking and dining, while a well-appointed bathroom completes the downstairs layout. This property also benefits from a generous rear garden, perfect for outdoor activities and relaxation. Upstairs, you will find three bright and spacious bedrooms, each providing comfortable living space. This home is ideally located in a mature and popular residential area of Ballyfermot, close to local amenities and well-connected to the city centre via frequent bus routes and easy access to the N7 and M50 motorways."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, pendant lighting & a fireplace with tiled surroundings.\r\n\r\nUnder Stair Storage\r\n1.686 X 0.878\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n4.830 x 2.534\r\nWith a range of floor & eye level fitted presses, tiled flooring, recessed lighting, wash machine, dishwasher, oven, hob, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n3.133 x 1.790\r\nWith tiled flooring/walls, WC, WHB, shower, storage cabinet behind mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.858 x 3.386 \r\nWith laminate wood flooring, pendant lighting & built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\n3.543 x 2.944\r\nWith laminate wood flooring & pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.667 x 2.198\r\nWith laminate wood flooring & pendant lighting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Sought after location\r\nFreshly painted throughout\r\nLarge Rear Garden\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nExcellent condition throughout"
      },
